hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Uthman ibn Affan (Allah amridhie): Nabii mtukufu (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipanda mlima Hira, Hira ukatetemeka. Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: ((Tulia ewe Hira, kwani juu yako hakuna ila Nabii, au Siddiq, au Shahidi)). Na [wakati huo] juu yake walikuwa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), Abu Bakr, Umar, Uthman, Ali, Talhah, az-Zubayr, Sa'd na Sa'id ibn Zayd (Allah awaridhie)."
